    "note": "Cumulative ladder: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 'Rite of Sugar Scoop' (Zone True DMG = 24% of an attack's total on Additional-DMG targets), E2 'Guide of Dream Tour' (Zone Additional DMG -> 120% + 1 extra instance) and E5 'Clock of Wonder Origin' (Skill/Talent level bumps) either need a second damaging ally to surface Zone Additional DMG or only move off-buff magnitudes, so a solo-Tribbie kept fixture cannot observe them; they are documented not asserted. E3 'Trove of Morning Glow' Ult+2/Basic+1 raise 'Guess Who Lives Here' 0.3 -> 0.33 and 'Hundred Rockets' 0.3 -> 0.33. E4 'Peace of Empathy Bond' makes allies ignore 18% DEF while Numinosity lasts (tri_e4 defIgnore 0.18). E6 'Morrow of Star Shine': after the Ultimate, Tribbie launches her Talent Follow-Up ATK ('Busy as Tribbie'). Fixtures run one battle per rank e0..e6."
